<section class="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="approach-num">— METODO</div>
    <blockquote class="approach-quote">
      L'IT non è un reparto da appaltare al miglior offerente.
      È un asset da progettare, e poi da custodire con attenzione.
    </blockquote>
    <cite class="approach-attr">Marco Regalia · Senior System Administrator</cite>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .approach {
    background: var(--paper-dark);
    padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 112px) 0;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .approach-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .approach-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .approach-quote::before {
    content: "\201C";
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.4em;
    line-height: 0;
    vertical-align: -0.25em;
    margin-right: 0.1em;
  }
  .approach-attr {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
